  "body": "### 2026-08-23\n\n### Chores\r\n+ Rust version bump to 1.91.1, [9b0455083d92101d3c1f9c1c6d818fc3165bebbe]\r\n+ GitHub workflow updated, [46058e9a73dd55a7ae1c95ca3abca23917c1cdcb]\r\n+ dependencies updated, [8d5d86b493ac96ac6fd739d3a4a133cd8a5f77a7], [34c1308d906fe807ad2df02e18c89fd91e35134a]\r\n\r\n### Features\r\n+ use `futures::stream` instead of `tokio::spawn`, [4f94ed82eac32555c0f93b09f194d3d7189c1814]\r\n\r\n### Fixes\r\n+ use saturating arithmetic, [81ab40dddba476e12b60ff284e0715ab88159adf]\r\n+ parse_arg check for 0 values, [9fe2b6dc1ab7348e0442a27cf5b81ff0953df4b2]\r\n+ _typos.toml, [d8216adb883e4f2cc168911383143816b6ed252d]\r\n\r\n\nsee <a href='https://github.com/mrjackwills/havn/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md'>CHANGELOG.md</a> for more details\n"
